<title>RUSSIA: Russia Jan household savings up to 117.7 trln rbls.</title>
<headline>Russia Jan household savings up to 117.7 trln rbls.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian households' savings and deposits in the state-owned Sberegatelny Bank RF and other banks rose in January to 86.5 trillion and 31.2 trillion roubles respectively, the State Statistics Committee said on Thursday.</p>
<p>				Jan 97	  Dec 96	  Jan 96</p>
<p>    Household deposits  117.7	   115.9	    75.2</p>
<p>comprising:</p>
<p>	In Sberbank	  86.5	    85.0	    51.1</p>
<p>	In other banks     31.2	    30.9	    24.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures for start of month in trillion roubles.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
